=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Nivorajean} (I-9) to flag the quest.
* Go to {z:Sacrarium} and obtain a {@i:Scr. Chest Key|1061} {i:Sacrarium Chest Key|Scr. Chest Key|1061}
** Can be purchased from {p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} after obtaining {@k} {k:Rhapsody in White}.
* Locate the position of a Treasure Chest, making sure to note the location.
** {c=#007AFF:[]}** The blue colored squares on our maps are a potential spawn location of a Treasure Chest.**
* Open the Treasure chest to obtain {@k} {k:Piece of Ripped Floorplans|Piece of ripped floorplans}
